flowchart TB
  CLI[CLI / TUI] --> TE[TaskExecution<br/>任务尝试与完成策略]
  CLI --> GR[Grading<br/>gate / measure 评价]
  CLI --> EE[ExperimentExecution<br/>批次、重复、汇总]
  EE -->|eval 策略发起| TE
  EE -->|measure| GR
  TE -->|策略要求验收时 gate| GR
  TE -->|TaskRun 级申请、暂停、释放| SB[SandboxProvisioning<br/>沙箱供给]
  GR -->|评价者沙箱| SB
  TE -->|带租约运行| AE[AgentExecutionService<br/>运行、轨迹、归档、停止核对]
  GR -->|Agent 型评分器| AE
  AE -->|按租约占用与工具桥接| SB
  SB --> W[Workspace 管理]
  SB --> R[Environment 治理]
  TE --> ST[交付与证据存取端口]
  AE --> ST
  GR --> ST
  DRV[受理与驱动基础设施] -.->|推进与核对| TE
  DRV -.-> AE
  DRV -.-> EE
